      "Week 6 gathers sets, functions, and remaining algebra such as simultaneous equations and quadratic graphs. This is also the week to stop saying you do not do constructions. Book a long session with compass and ruler. Construction questions are slow if you have not touched the instruments since junior school. They are routine if you have.",
