    slug: "waec-biology-diagrams-examiners-look-for",
    title: "WAEC Biology Diagrams: What Examiners Actually Look For",
    description: "Labels, scale, and the difference between a pretty sketch and a mark-earning drawing.",
    date: "2026-04-03",
